@startuml
!theme crt-green

participant Client
participant Server


== Network Hello ==
Client -> Server: Supported TLS version and cipher suites supported by client

Server -> Client: Selected cipher suite\nServer Key Share
Server -> Client: Server's Public Key\nDigital Signature from Authority
Server -> Client: Cryptographic signature proving ownership of the private key

== Authority/Trust Verification ==
box PublicCertificate
    Client -> Client: Look up Authority Certificate in local trust store
    Client -> Client: Verify Digital Signature on Server Certificate\nCheck expiration date\nCheck domain name match (service name matches signed certificate)
    alt Verification Succeeds
        note over Client: Server identity is Trusted
    else Verification Fails
        Client -> Server: Alert: Handshake Failure (Connection Closed)
    end
box rect

== Exchange Keys ==
Client -> Server: Key calculation for decryption
Server -> Client: Key calculation for decryption
note over Client, Server: Both sides now have the shared secret key for network encryption\nwithout ever sending it over the network.

@enduml
